  partName: Sensor (3)
  description: The Sensor (3) is a tiny, elongated component positioned at the middle-center-center
    of the engine, made of Material.001, which monitors various engine parameters
    such as temperature, pressure, or speed. Its small size and central location
    allow it to provide accurate readings, and an interesting detail is its ability
    to detect even slight changes in engine performance.
